av\">\n     <a class=\"backtotop\">\n      <span>\n       Top\n      </span>\n     </a>\n    </p>\n   </nav>\n   <div class=\"info-col Biography\">\n    <h1 class=\"content-title\">\n     Biography\n    </h1>\n    <section class=\"text\">\n     <p>\n      <a>\n       CV\n      </a>\n     </p>\n     <p>\n      For thirty years I have been making drawings, paintings, 16mm films and videos. My films integrate hybrid forms and traditions including autobiography, experimental tropes, cinema verit&eacute;, scripted narrative, ethnographic observation and dance and performance, engaging with cultural and political themes, such as identity, nationalism, the transgression of borders, displacement, nuclear arms and war, foregrounding the human experience and personal testimony.\n     </p>\n     <p>\n      <b>\n       Contact:\n      </b>\n      <br>\n      <a>\n       [EMAIL REDACTED]\n      </a>\n     </p>\n     <p>\n      <b>\n       For internship inquiries:\n      </b>\n      <br>\n      <a>\n       [EMAIL REDACTED]\n      </a>\n     </p>\n    </section>\n   </div>\n   <p class=\"pagenav\">\n    <a class=\"backtotop\">\n     <span>\n      Top\n     </span>\n    </a>\n   </p>\n   <!-- /content -->\n  </div>\n  <!-- /wrap -->\n </body>\n</html>\n",
